OL,3,GNEWSATen-year-old lights up the London
OL,4,AEye for PANDAS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old campaigner has lit up the
OL,7,FLondon Eye to raise awareness of a
OL,8,Flittle-known condition that causes
OL,9,Fsevere psychiatric symptoms in
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FAlbie, from Oxfordshire, has spent the
OL,13,Fpast two years raising awareness of
OL,14,FPaediatric Acute-onset Neuropsychiatric
OL,15,FSyndrome (PANS) after a family member
OL,16,Fwas diagnosed with the condition.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
