OL,3,GNEWSATen-year-old lights up the London
OL,4,AEye for PANDAS
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring that time, he's written hundreds
OL,7,Fof letters to public figures and health
OL,8,Fbodies, and has received replies
OL,9,Fcelebrating his efforts from both Prime
OL,10,FMinister Andy Burnham and King Charles
OL,11,FIII.
OL,13,FOn 10 October, his efforts culminated
OL,14,Fin illuminating the world-famous London
OL,15,FEye in green, the colour to mark World
OL,16,FPANS/PANDAS Awareness Day.
